  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanded innovative solutions and disruptive technologies within formal and informal sectors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The interventions planned are anchored under KCJF Outcome 1, with a focus on accelerating the adoption of expanded innovative solutions and disruptive technologies within formal and informal sectors; while promoting safe and inclusive innovation to drive growth and shared UK-Kenya priorities. They include: 
1. Cluster-based Approach: Development and operationalisation 
2. Tech and Digital Venture Building Pathways 
3. Commercialisation of AI Ventures and use cases 
4. Women-led science and tech Innovations</narrative>
  </description>
